WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
- Wooo! Knicks take Playoff Mountain!

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:06.875
- We’re going from the base camp to our face on a stamp, jueard!

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:09.916
- Bing bong! Yeah! We still do that!

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:13.541
- Hello! It’s your cool dad, Adam Silver.

00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:16.916
Welcome to the Eastern Face of Playoff Mountain!

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.166
Each team will traverse their own path,

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:21.416
finding opponents on their way to the summit,

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:24.750
where the champion will take on the best of the Western Face.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.750
Please, make your way to your assigned path.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.166
- Hell yeah! I'm hype! Let's go!

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.000
-Ahhh!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
-Chill, bro. The strongest heroes of the East Lands are all here.

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:37.041
[laughing]

00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:40.500
[beep]

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.333
[beep]
- On your mark...

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:41.791
get set...

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.625
[beep]

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.083
Ball!
[starting tone]

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.250
- Slow down!

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.666
If we get lost I'm gonna get blamed and sent away!

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:50.625
Relax, I was brought here to guide you.

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.208
I think we need to go–

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:55.083
- I'm doing things my way! Rahhhh!

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:56.291
- [sigh]

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.166
- M-m-m-maybe, maybe we should turn around.

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:03.583
- Paul George writes that everywhere.

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:05.416
Let's find our first opponent.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:07.875
- Come out and fight!

00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:09.500
Looks like we got a bye.

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:11.708
- Uh...

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.500
Uh, guys?

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.041
- Huh?

00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:20.375
- Looks like the only thing stopping us from playoff success...

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:21.500
is ourselves!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.583
- [RJ:] Ahh!

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.291
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:28.708
♪♪♪ Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.583
♪♪♪ Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:34.958
♪♪♪ Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:41.666
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:44.125
[shrill laughter]

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.208
- All right, here’s what we do.

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:48.416
I take out all three of them! Rah!!

00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:49.541
- Julius! Slow down the pace!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.125
- Necessary spin move!

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:52.958
- Unnecessary spin move!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.041
- The Shadow Knicks have all our moves,

00:01:58.041 --> 00:01:59.250
including our flaws.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:00.125
Which means

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:02.791
Shadow RJ shouldn’t be able to shoot from there!

00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:05.166
- Hey! Not true!
- Hey! Not true!

00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:07.041
[power blast]

00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:08.500
[power charging]

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.750
[power blast]

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.375
- W-w-whoa!

00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.500
- Careful!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.708
Spikes!

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.000
- I’ve put up with a lot,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.958
but this is the Knicks team that finally breaks me!

00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:21.375
- Every year it’s something.

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:23.333
- I knew we shouldn't have given up on Reddish!

00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:25.916
- Maybe New York is a Nets town?

00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:27.541
- Too...far.

00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:28.583
- [evil laughter]

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:29.166
- [grunt]

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:33.750
- You’re...under...sized!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.500
- I’m the same height as Donovan Mitchell!

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.000
-[Evil laughter] You can’t defeat us!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.541
We’re the Knicks!

00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:45.583
We’re already defeated!

00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:47.416
- And we by far...

00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:49.375
- have more demons...

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:51.833
- than anyone else here!

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:54.375
Playoff pressure!

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:57.500
- Too...much...pressure...

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.625
I’m out.

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:01.541
- [Evil laughter] Collapsing in crunch time?

00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:04.416
The Knicks are so predictable.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.208
- Predictable? These Knicks?

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.791
Haha! Now Julius!

00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:11.208
- Jump...

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:12.458
pass!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:13.708
- Haha!

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:15.291
- [groaning]

00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:17.166
He left his feet! That should never work!

00:03:17.166 --> 00:03:20.291
You can’t escape me forever!

00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.833
I have facial recognition software!

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:23.833
[blast]

00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:25.583
- Looks like your plan worked.

00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:27.875
- All we needed was some heart.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.166
- Sorry I’m late.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:30.875
- En garde!

00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:33.333
Ah! It's just the Knicks.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.208
This should be an easy fight.

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:38.083
- Trust us, it’s harder than you think.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.583
- Who will reach the top of Playoff Mountain

00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:45.083
and lay claim to the new face of the league?

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:46.000
- Hell if I know.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.208
I just know they get paid a hell of a lot more than when I was a hero.

00:03:49.208 --> 00:03:51.916
Also my playoff prediction:

00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:55.375
Wizards and the great Bradley Beal win it all.

00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:56.458
- Shut up, Chuck!

00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:57.750
I’m trying to wrap up the season!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.333
- Uh oh! Rebound!

00:03:59.333 --> 00:04:01.875
- Ahh! Not the face! My endorsements!

